# Restart Sift after changes

When a change is meant to be seen in the running macOS app (UI, layout, GitKit, store, packaging of the app binary):

1. Build Debug: `xcodebuild -project App/Sift.xcodeproj -scheme Sift -configuration Debug -derivedDataPath /tmp/SiftBuild -destination 'platform=macOS' build`
2. Quit any running Sift (`pgrep` / `pkill` the `Sift.app/Contents/MacOS/Sift` process). Do not ask the user to quit first.
3. Open `/tmp/SiftBuild/Build/Products/Debug/Sift.app` with `open`.

Do this at the end of the turn. Do not only tell the user to reopen the app.
